        "slc_24d3201b83dc310945e09b3ebfd01b95d6bb16be3c11a350cf707cfe0dc49393"
      ],
      "text": "Rosettify is a local CLI/MCP utility providing deterministic workflow execution with zero network calls; it includes plan management, specs management, an atomic write cycle with a backup chain, and sequential phase enforcement."
    },
