      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_ec44342d5494d11e034c222b941abf552c15609f18d389531bd6577e072f9bdc"
      ],
      "text": "The curiocity harness drives coding-agent CLIs (Claude Code, Codex) through a real PTY, reads native on-disk transcripts, auto-answers agent questions via LLM, and scores runs with deterministic checks plus an LLM judge, gating CI on the aggregate."
    },
