  "summary": "Rosetta is an open-source engineering-governance system for AI coding agents, delivered as IDE plugins or an optional MCP server, layering core/organization/project instructions with workflows, guardrails, and subagent orchestration. The snapshot documents its architecture, command-alias interface, rosettify CLI/MCP tooling, and eval harnesses (curiocity, rosettify-prompts). Evidence coverage: 106 of 288 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
